学习建模和模型训练能力\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"engineering_ability\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"具备基础工程和工具使用能力\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"data_analysis_ability\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"具备数据分析和处理能力\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"recommendation_system\", \"group\": \"domain\", \"evidence\": \"研究方向与项目涉及推荐系统\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"nlp\", \"group\": \"domain\", \"evidence\": \"涉及自然语言处理相关技术\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"multimodal\", \"group\": \"domain\", \"evidence\": \"涉及多模态或视觉相关技术\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"data_mining\", \"group\": \"domain\", \"evidence\": \"涉及数据挖掘和分析\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"backend_service\", \"group\": \"domain\", \"evidence\": \"具备后端服务开发基础\", \"confidence\": 2}, {\"tag\": \"business_understanding\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"涉及业务相关经验\", \"confidence\": 1}]','[]','{}','后端工程型画像，具备服务端开发和基础架构能力。','rule','rule_fast_profile_v1',NULL,'2026-06-08 22:39:30','2026-06-08 22:39:30','2026-06-08 22:39:30','2026-06-08 22:39:30'),(36,8,2,'quality','v1','ready','backend_engineering','[{\"tag\": \"backend\", \"group\": \"direction\", \"evidence\": \"技能列表中出现工程关键词\", \"confidence\": 3}, {\"tag\": \"engineering_ability\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"具备基础工程和工具使用能力\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"algorithm\", \"group\": \"direction\", \"evidence\": \"技能和项目涉及算法与机器学习\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"research\", \"group\": \"direction\", \"evidence\": \"包含研究方向或论文相关经历\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"data\", \"group\": \"direction\", \"evidence\": \"包含数据处理和分析技能\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"research_ability\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"研究方向与论文经验\", \"confidence\": 1}]','[{\"tag\": \"algorithm\", \"group\": \"direction\", \"evidence\": \"技能和项目涉及算法与机器学习\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"backend\", \"group\": \"direction\", \"evidence\": \"技能列表中出现工程关键词\", \"confidence\": 3}, {\"tag\": \"research\", \"group\": \"direction\", \"evidence\": \"包含研究方向或论文相关经历\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"data\", \"group\": \"direction\", \"evidence\": \"包含数据处理和分析技能\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"research_ability\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"研究方向与论文经验\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"experiment_ability\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"包含模型实验和指标评估经历\", \"confidence\": 2}, {\"tag\": \"modeling_ability\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"具备深度学习建模和模型训练能力\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"engineering_ability\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"具备基础工程和工具使用能力\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"data_analysis_ability\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"具备数据分析和处理能力\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"recommendation_system\", \"group\": \"domain\", \"evidence\": \"研究方向与项目涉及推荐系统\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"nlp\", \"group\": \"domain\", \"evidence\": \"涉及自然语言处理相关技术\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"multimodal\", \"group\": \"domain\", \"evidence\": \"涉及多模态或视觉相关技术\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"data_mining\", \"group\": \"domain\", \"evidence\": \"涉及数据挖掘和分析\", \"confidence\": 1}, {\"tag\": \"backend_service\", \"group\": \"domain\", \"evidence\": \"具备后端服务开发基础\", \"confidence\": 2}, {\"tag\": \"business_understanding\", \"group\": \"capability\", \"evidence\": \"涉及业务相关经验\", \"confidence\": 1}]','[]','{}','后端工程型画像，具备服务端开发和基础架构能力。','rule','rule_quality_fallback_v1',NULL,'2026-06-08 22:39:30','2026-06-08 22:39:30','2026-06-08 22:39:30','2026-06-08 22:39:30');
